  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap buffer overflow in three-way merge\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-105437.patch: use size_t and st_add*()\n       for the xdiff merge buffer size computations\n     - CVE-2026-105437\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: .git overwrite via over-long cache entry names\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-111760.patch: use size_t for tree-walk\n       path lengths, reject cache entries with over-long names and add\n       index.maxPathLen\n     - CVE-2026-111760\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: arbitrary file write via fast-import stream\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-114466.patch: forbid the export-pack-edges\n       option in the input stream without --allow-unsafe-features\n     - CVE-2026-114466",
